ns. Here we run down the most significant alterations.</p> <a href="https://www.theguardian.com/film/2026/jul/20/the-odyssey-what-christopher-nolan-changed-invented-left-out">Continue reading...</a>ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;fxJ0Plb3r_0dXnme0-WhCb01HAIdevAD_YYHZXYeV0oƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkx9ni:///sha-256;sz7mfpPDMnG6lJpy_aE_o1uA_sDayWjusNtLDm0UqKcƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;l71MIqk9Q65Q4UW2hz0MH9rfEXgwE5cswZD6zsyvvOAƒdpairƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;xpbvtWhcR0l-i5m34yft9acNLtzwuhuf3e4Dw87c7RIƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarkefalseƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;rE35YMUjlf76t1dGycBVpNcd-yij2JtXTB7XJkk2ZRkƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarkdtrueƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;P4heB7H-6nFGDFEOysEyxUaX2idAMAHfTHLlgsRHCD8ƒdpairƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;HQ_CoF1IMEAPWJZLBZsNY0UVjOqjK0KSTL4U-OrrVMAƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkdTextƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;xVX8C8pFXBNbsx5T1SeRVJ_1bQUmLQKphkhgEoVG6JYƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkqSyndicationSourceƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;O39lyo_cZNN5yEjm3Do9XMt4Ac9iOtCVyVThJrxE28wƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkx(urn:rmn:predicate:source-reports-summaryƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;qQq82jsBQx6XecPUvv39cTTHlzwJt34Ej7yWy0RKyWcƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunit